      <p begin="01:56.650" end="01:59.560" ttm:agent="v1">Let me clarify bitch I been verified</p>

      <p begin="01:59.560" end="02:02.380" ttm:agent="v1">I can see it in your eyes you look terrified</p>

      <p begin="02:02.380" end="02:05.190" ttm:agent="v1">I'm killin' him her who however you identify</p>

      <p begin="02:05.190" end="02:06.790" ttm:agent="v1">God look at my bod</p>

      <p begin="02:06.790" end="02:09.730" ttm:agent="v1">거울을 쳐다봐도 나도 반했다</p>

